"Network (LAN), or to a private local network (PAN).  Your LAN, or PAN, can "
"be connected to the web, or not, because the internet will be ignored. The "
"KBservers running on the LAN or PAN are shown.  Connecting to a listed "
"KBserver is not done immediately, even if you select one; but those listed "
"are stored for possible use later.  Repeated discovery attempts are "
"allowed.  If someone closes down a running KBserver, select its ipAddress "
"and click Remove Selected Entry."
msgstr ""

